                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku naagunagire Okuzimu hamwe n'abarikushuuma omu Kiina, naareetera amahanga kutetema ahabw'okuhurira omutsindo gw'okugwa kwagwo. N'ahabw'ekyo emiti yoona ey'omuri Edeni, eyaatoorainwe kandi erikukira oburungi omuri Lebanooni, yaahuumurizibwa ahu yaabaire eri Okuzimu owa Nyamuteza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
